answers.approach:
Sends cannot unsend—
meter what cannot undo;
log the cause, not who.

Give each agent its own narrow key,
Route every side effect through one policy.
Set spend and reach limits, then shadow each flight;
Log inputs, intent, and receipts signed tight.
Treat email and webpages as whispers untrue;
Let data propose, never grant tools what to do.
Don’t make human nodding our rollback regime;
For sends and spent money, containment’s still a dream.
